Language acquisition is the process by which humans acquire the capacity to perceive and comprehend language. In other words, it is how human beings gain the ability to be aware of language, to understand it, and to produce and use words and sentences to communicate.

Text 2
Sign languages (also known as signed languages) are languages that use the visual-manual modality to convey meaning rather than spoken words. They are expressed through manual articulation in combination with non-manual markers, and are full-fledged natural languages with their own grammar and lexicon.', 'Based on the texts, how would the author of Text 2 most likely respond to the argument in Text 1?', '[{"id": "A", "text": "By arguing that sign languages are not languages."}, {"id": "B", "text": "By claiming that only spoken languages can be acquired."}, {"id": "C", "text": "By noting that sign languages are full natural languages with their own grammar, which the capacity described in Text 1 can acquire."}, {"id": "D", "text": "By denying that sign languages have grammar."}]'::jsonb, NULL, 'wikipedia-cc-by-sa-4', 'Wikipedia (CC BY-SA 4.0)', 'CC BY-SA 4.0', 'Wikipedia, "Language acquisition", CC BY-SA 4.0, retrieved 2026-11-02. https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Language_acquisition; Wikipedia, "Sign language", CC BY-SA 4.0, retrieved 2026-11-02. https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sign_language', FALSE, 'active') ON CONFLICT (id) DO UPDATE SET external_id = EXCLUDED.external_id, assessments = EXCLUDED.assessments, section = EXCLUDED.section, domain = EXCLUDED.domain, skill = EXCLUDED.skill, difficulty = EXCLUDED.difficulty, format = EXCLUDED.format, stimulus = EXCLUDED.stimulus, prompt = EXCLUDED.prompt, choices = EXCLUDED.choices, figure_metadata = EXCLUDED.figure_metadata, source_id = EXCLUDED.source_id, source_name = EXCLUDED.source_name, license = EXCLUDED.license, attribution = EXCLUDED.attribution, is_released_practice_set = EXCLUDED.is_released_practice_set, status = 'active';
INSERT INTO public.question_keys (question_id, correct_answer, acceptable_answers, explanation, distractor_rationales) VALUES ('RW-M37-X011', 'C', ARRAY['C']::TEXT[], 'Text 1 describes language acquisition as the human capacity to perceive, understand, and produce language. Text 2 establishes that sign languages are full natural languages with their own grammar and lexicon, so its author would include them among the languages that capacity acquires.', '{"D": "Text 2 says sign languages have their own grammar.", "B": "Text 2 calls them full-fledged natural languages.", "A": "Text 2 explicitly calls them languages."}'::jsonb) ON CONFLICT (question_id) DO UPDATE SET correct_answer = EXCLUDED.correct_answer, acceptable_answers = EXCLUDED.acceptable_answers, explanation = EXCLUDED.explanation, distractor_rationales = EXCLUDED.distractor_rationales;
